OL,3,GNEWSAInside the 'scariest house on
OL,4,ARightmove'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn old station house that is up for
OL,7,Fauction in Nottinghamshire has had
OL,8,Funexpected attention after being dubbed
OL,9,Fthe "scariest house on Rightmove".
OL,11,FThe property in Bleasby dates back to
OL,12,Fthe 1840s, when the railway station
OL,13,Fopened, and would have been home to the
OL,14,Fstation masters who were responsible
OL,15,Ffor opening and closing the station
OL,16,Fbarriers.
OL,18,FAlthough steeped in local history, the
OL,19,Feerie character of the house in its
OL,20,Flisting images is what seems to have
OL,21,Fgathered interest.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
