OL,3,GNEWSAInside the 'scariest house on
OL,4,ARightmove'
OL,5,
OL,6,FArea manager at Auction House Notts &
OL,7,FDerby, Jonathan Way, said he believed
OL,8,Fit was a "creepy doll" left standing in
OL,9,Fthe corner of a bedroom that had
OL,10,Fcaptured people's imaginations.
